      "englishText": "Avadhānī: The leather bag in my hand proves that I am a cobbler. I also have a skin. So it is proved that I am a cobbler. I also like to search for new things like new words (note the pun on pāda, having the double meaning of 'words' as well as 'steps' and 'footprints'), new thoughts etc. Without it my work would not be possible. Therefore, I am obliged to you and I accept that I am a cobbler (charmakāra). \n\nNiṣiddhākṣarī: (playing with the word charmakāra) You are not a cobbler (charmakāra) but a person who creates wonders (camatkārakāra1). \n\n(He now continues from where the Avadhānī had been interrupted). 'La' is prohibited.\n\n(Anticipating that the Avadhānī would like to create the word 'a-ma-la' meaning pure, he prohibits the next syllable 'la'.)\n\nAvadhānī: 'rtya' (thus creating the word 'amartya' meaning immortal)\n\nNiṣiddhākṣarī: 'na' is forbidden (anticipating 'nda', which would form 'amartyānanda' meaning 'the joy of immortality).\n\nAvadhānī: 'tma' (thus creating the word 'amartyātmā', meaning 'the immortal soul').\n\nNiṣiddhākṣarī: (unable to guess the word in the Avadhānī's mind, requests him) Please give the next syllable\n\nThe Bell: (sounds for the 1st time.)\n\nAvadhānī: (on hearing the soft sound of the bell, which was not loud enough): Please strike it a little more strongly!\n\n1The word camatkāra implies miracle, surprise, but also poetical charm — \nboth of which the Avadhani is supposed to show.",
      "sanskritDevanagari": "अवधानी: अहं चर्मकारः इत्यत्रा प्रमाणमस्ति चर्मभýका मम समीपे अस्ति ।   एवं ममापि अस्ति एवं चर्मए अतः चर्मकारत्वं सिद्धम् ।  नव अन्वेषणमपि कर्तुमिच्छामि ।  नव नव पदान्वेषणम् ।  नव नव भावान्वेषणम् ।  एतत्  विना न सम्भवति मम क्रिया ।  अतः भवतः अनुग्रहेण अहं मम चर्मकारत्वम् अङ्गीकरोमि ।\n\nनिषिद्धाक्षरी:  भवान् चर्मकारो न भवतिए चमत्कारकारः ! तदनन्तरं ल निषिद्धः । लकारः निषिद्धः ।\n\nअवधानी:  र्त्य\n\nनिषिद्धाक्षरी:  नकारः निषिद्धः । \n\nअवधानी:  त्म\n\nनिषिद्धाक्षरी:  एकः अक्षरः दीयताम् ।                                                       🔔 (घण्टा १)\n\nअवधानी:  किञ्चत् बयेन ताड;तु (घण्टां प्रति)"
