      "englishText": "Eshu: Today the Department of Sanskrit (of Pondicherry University) has arranged a joint seminar with the Veda Pratisthanam. Please describe the aims and objectives of this seminar to this gathering. \n\nAvadhānī: (composes the shloka in Anushtup metre):\n'śrutisāram samākīrṇam vivicya hitakāṅkṣayā\nlokasya shreyase sarve...'\n\n(Delving deep, with the desire to do good for the benefit of all, the scattered essence of the Vedas..)\n\nThe Bell: (sounds for the 6th time)\n\nAprastutaprasanga: (interrupts the Avadhānī when he utters 'sarve' (all), creating a wordplay): Are you doing a survey (here)?\n\nAvadhānī: Yes, all Pandits here have come to do a survey of what is there in the Vedas. (He\n\ncontinues with the shloka he had started): '.... shreyase sarve cinvanti vibudhā iha'\n\n(for the Good of people all pandits here pluck...)\n\nVyastākṣarī: The eleventh syllable is 'dra'.\n\nAvadhānī: 'dra'\n\nVyastākṣarī: The 16th syllable is 'rah'.\n\nAvadhānī: 'rah!'\n\nThe Bell: (sounds for the 7th time) \n\nPresident: The Avadhānī has answered once all the questions which were asked. The first round is herewith completed and I request the Avadhānī to start the second round. \n( The Avadhānī must remember all the questions asked, the tasks given and the lines composed by him in the first round and continue from there.)",
      "sanskritDevanagari": "आशुः  अ| संस्कृत विभागेन वेदप्रतिÏानस्; साहा¸येन वि}त् गोÏी आयोजिता ।  अस्याः उíेश्;म् अत्रा आगतेभ्यः नि#प;न्तु इति प्राथ्र्ाये ।\n\nअवधानी:  Jुतिसारं समाकीण± विविच्; हितकाÈक्षया ।\nलोकस्; Jे;से सवर्े---                                                              🔔 (घण्टा ६)\n\nअप्रस्तुतप्रसङ्गः:  किं भोः भवन्तः सवर्े कुर्वन्ित वा ? \n\nअवधानी: अाम् --- सवर्े कर्तुमेव आगताः । अत्रा सवर्ेऽपि पण्डिताः वेदे किमस्ति किमस्ति इति सवर्े कर्तुमेव आगताः । ---Jे;से सवर्े चिन्वन्ित विबुधा इह ।।\n\nव्यस्ताक्षरी:  आर्य एकादशमक्षरं द्र\n\nअवधानी:  द्र ।                                                                \n\nव्यस्ताक्षरी:  षोडशमक्षरं रः\n\nअवधानी:  रः                                                                   🔔 (घण्टा ७)\n\nसभापतिः:  एकधा सवर्ेषामपि प्रश्नानां समाधानं दÙाम् ।  प्रथमं चÈØमणं सातम् ।   पुनः  }तीयः पादः     प्रदानाथ± प`च्छाामि अवधानी:महोद;म् ।"
