      "englishText": "(The President confirmes that the Avadhānī has completed his Avadhāna of eight items. Now he has to restate all the verses in their entirety. This is Dhāraṇā.)\n\nAvadhānī: Firstly the shloka (asked by the Niṣiddhākṣarī) in praise of Sri Aurobindo:\n\t\t\namartyātmā martyalo'nge bhūdayena manahsthiram/\nkritye kuśalatābrahma rupitam yena te namah//\n\n(An immortal soul in a mortal body,\nThe mind has been steadied by the King of the earth,\nTo Thee, who hast established the Brahman of Perfection in works,\nTo Thee my salutation)\n\nPresident: We all have witnessed the great power of concentration of the Avadhānī. The whole shloka has been told without break. Congratulations!.",
      "sanskritDevanagari": "अवधानी:  प्रथमम् अरविन्दमहाशयानां स्तुतिः ।\n  \nअमर्त्यात्मा मर्त्यलोके भुवनायेन मनःस्थिरम् ।\n  व`ðत्ये वुðशयताब्रà :पितं येन ते नमः ।।\n\nसभापतिः:  अवधानिनः धारणा  अस्माभ्िाः अ| द्रÎुं शक्;ते । सम्पू.र्ाः श्लोकः विन;मवियम्बं एकवारमेव  पठîते ।  अभ्िानन्दनानि  ।"
