      "englishText": "Now, at this point, in conclusion, I would like to say something about us (The Avadhānī sings a composition of his)\n\nvayam samskritasya krite kimapi kim na karavāma\nsvayam saṅgītaśaktyā siddhietra racayāma\nshravanam sambhāṣaṇam samskrite nirantaram\nchātraiḥ saha mitraih saha sarvaih saha sarvadāpi\nsvādhyāyaḥ sadrachanam satkavitādi mananam\nsamskrita iti nihshrenim samāruhya vilasāma\n\nvayam samskritasya krite kimapi kim na karavāma\nvayam samskritasya krite kimapi kimapi karavāma\nkimapi karavāma\n\n(Let us do something in whatever small measure for the sake of Sanskrit\nBy united effort we can achieve the goal\nHearing, speaking Sanskrit always\nWith students and friends, with everyone and always.\nSelf-study, good composition, pondering over good literature and good poems,\nSanskrit is the ladder; once we have climbed up, we may sit comfortably.\nLet us do something in whatever small measure for the sake of Sanskrit.)",
      "sanskritDevanagari": "अवधानी:  परिसमापनसमये एकं लघु अस्माकं विषये किञ्चत् वक्तुमिच्छामि ।\n\nवयं संस्कृतस्य कृते किमपि किं न करवाम \nस्वयं सङ्घटतश्क्त्या सिद्धिमत्र रचयाम\nवयं संस्कृतस्य कृते किमपि किं न करवाम\nस्वयं सङ्घटतश्क्त्या सिद्धिमत्र रचयाम \nश्रवणं सम्भाषणं संस्कृते निरन्तरम्\nश्रवणं सम्भाषणं संस्कृते निरन्तरम्\nछात्रैः सह मित्रैः सह सर्वैः सह सर्वदापि\nस्वाध्यायः सद्रचनं सत्कवितादिमननम्\nसंस्कृत इति निःश्रेणी समारुह्य विलसाम \nवयं संस्कृतस्य कृते किमपि किं न  करवाम\nवयं संस्कृतस्य कृते किमपि किमपि करवाम \nकिमपि किमपि करवाम ।।"
